flowchart TD
  Start[Automatic v4 session] --> Local[Local analysis and deterministic design]
  Local --> Arrangement[OpenRouter chooses from authoritative candidates]
  Arrangement -->|valid authoritative plan| Compile[Compile and execute]
  Arrangement -->|provider or validation failure| Choice[Retry AI, change model, or cancel]
  Compile --> Technical{Technical gate passes?}
  Technical -->|no| Review[Candidate Review with preserved draft]
  Technical -->|yes| Musical{OpenRouter recommends this mix?}
  Musical -->|no| Correct
  Musical -->|yes| Options{Distinct option safely available?}
  Options -->|yes| Arrangement
  Options -->|no or limit reached| Review
  Correct -->|limit reached or no safe preset| Review
  Correct -->|allowed| Compile
  Review --> Human{Human selects a valid draft?}
  Human -->|yes| Approve[Append human approval]
  Human -->|request correction| Correct
  Human -->|cancel| Cancelled[Cancelled]
  Approve --> Promote[Verify and promote selected candidate]
